window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>My crimes are legion. My sentence eternal.</b></p> <p>Hell fractured my soul into dust and left me broken, yet I deserved so much worse.</p> <p>Finally free from Lucifer’s torment, I must atone. But the lives I took and the pain I caused haunt me every day.</p> <p>Half angel, half demon, but nowhere near whole.</p> <p>Until I meet <i>her</i>.</p> <p>I should not want Zoe Dawes, but she whispers her desires in my dreams and chases away my nightmares.</p> <p>When an ancient evil returns, only I can stop him. But if I do, I risk losing everything - including the woman who reminds me what it is to feel. To live.</p> <p>Zoe is mine. And nothing will keep us apart.</p> <p>I work for the Bureau of the Occult and the Other. Zoe is my partner.</p> <p>My name is Sinclair. But you can call me Sin.</p> <p><b>Narrated by Maxine Mitchell and Jason Clarke.</b></p>"; 
